ets/css/identity.css"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/assets/images/portfolio-icon-180.png"><link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest"></head><body data-page="hire-me.html" class="academy page-service master-refresh commission-page"><header class="academy-header" id="top"><a class="academy-brand personal-brand" href="/"><span>Bakhtawar Khan<small>Personal Digital Portfolio · MBK Global</small></span></a><button class="academy-menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="academy-nav">Menu <span>+</span></button><nav id="academy-nav" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/">Home</a><a href='/about'>About</a><a href='/projects'>Projects</a><a href='/services'>Services</a><a aria-current='page' class='header-cta' href='/hire-me'>Let’s talk <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><details class="portfolio-more"><summary>More</summary><div class="portfolio-panel"><section><h2>Professional work</h2><a href='/case-studies'>Case Studies</a><a href='/changelog'>Projects Changelog</a><a href='/delivered-project'>Process</a><a href='/resources'>Resources</a><a href='/news'>Notes</a></section><section><h2>Contact &amp; career</h2><a href='/book-a-call'>Book a Call</a><a href='/resume'>Resume / CV</a><a href='/hire-me'>Hire Me</a></section><section><h2>Content &amp; media</h2><a href='/gallery'>Gallery</a><a href='/blog'>Blog &amp; Articles</a><a href='/faq'>FAQs</a></section><section><h2>Personal brand</h2><a href='/about-muhammad-bakhtawar-khan'>Founder Profile</a><a href='/social'>Social Profiles</a><a href='/official-links'>Official Links</a></section></div></details><button class="theme-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Switch color theme">◐</button></nav></header>
<a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a><main class="wrap inner-page hire-page academy-main" id="main-content"><section class="academy-page-hero expanded-hero "><div><div class="academy-breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span>Work with me</div><p class="academy-kicker">Work with me / BAKHTAWAR KHAN</p><h1>Your next project,<br><em>with a clearer starting point.</em></h1><p class="expanded-deck">Bring a website, application or automation problem. I can help shape the brief, identify integration constraints and agree on a practical scope before anything is built.</p><div class="editorial-actions"><a class='academy-text-link' href='/projects'>Explore the work ↗</a><a class='academy-text-link' href='/hire-me'>Start a conversation ↗</a></div></div></section><section class="editorial-section" id="project-enquiry"><div class="editorial-label">01 / PROJECT BRIEF</div><div><h2>A few details make a better conversation.</h2><p>Use this form to prepare a WhatsApp enquiry. It does not submit to this website or store your brief here. Don’t include passwords, API keys, customer records or confidential material. You review and send the message in WhatsApp.</p><form class="project-form" id="whatsappProjectForm"><div class="form-grid"><label>Your name *<input autocomplete="name" name="name" placeholder="Enter your name" required></label><label>WhatsApp / phone *<input autocomplete="tel" name="phone" placeholder="Your contact number" required></label><label>Email address<input autocomplete="email" name="email" placeholder="you@example.com" type="email"></label><label>Service you need *<select name="service" required><option value="">Choose a service</option><option>Website design / development</option><option>Portfolio or landing page</option><option>React / frontend development</option><option>API integration</option><option>AI tools / automation</option><option>WhatsApp bot</option><option>AI chatbot discovery</option><option>Telegram bot discovery</option><option>Social media automation discovery</option><option>Technical SEO</option><option>UI/UX or graphic design</option><option>Other / not sure yet</option></select></label><label>Estimated budget<select name="budget"><option value="Not specified">Prefer to discuss</option><option>Under $100</option><option>$100–$300</option><option>$300–$700</option><option>$700+</option><option>To be discussed</option></select></label><label>Preferred timeline<select name="timeline"><option value="Flexible">Flexible</option><option>As soon as possible</option><option>Within 2 weeks</option><option>Within a month</option><option>Specific date to discuss</option></select></label><label class="form-full">Project details *<textarea name="details" placeholder="What do you want to build? Mention key features, references or goals." required rows="5"></textarea></label></div><button class="button button-primary form-submit" type="submit">Send details on WhatsApp ↗</button><p class="form-privacy">Your details are placed into a WhatsApp message. Nothing is sent until you press Send in WhatsApp.</p><p aria-live="polite" class="form-success" hidden id="formSuccess" role="status">Thank you! Your project details are ready in WhatsApp. Please press Send there to complete your enquiry.</p></form></div></section><section class="editorial-section"><div class="editorial-label">02 / FREELANCE PLATFORMS</div><div><h2>Choose the channel you trust.</h2><p>Direct enquiries are available now. Marketplace profiles are not published yet; the fields below are owner-editable placeholders, not active profiles.</p><div class="platform-options"><article><p class="academy-kicker">PROFILE DETAILS PENDING</p><h3>Hire Me on Fiverr</h3><dl><dt>Profile URL</dt><dd>Not provided — no active link</dd><dt>Profile description</dt><dd>To be completed by Bakhtawar Khan</dd><dt>Services</dt><dd>To be confirmed on the published profile</dd><dt>Portfolio</dt><dd><a href='/projects'>Review work on this website</a></dd></dl></article><article><p class="academy-kicker">PROFILE DETAILS PENDING</p><h3>Work with Me on Upwork</h3><dl><dt>Profile URL</dt><dd>Not provided — no active link</dd><dt>Profile description</dt><dd>To be completed by Bakhtawar Khan</dd><dt>Services</dt><dd>To be confirmed on the published profile</dd><dt>Portfolio</dt><dd><a href='/projects'>Review work on this website</a></dd></dl></article></div><p>No ratings, reviews, earnings or verification status are claimed. If another marketplace becomes relevant, its genuine profile can be added after the owner confirms it.</p></div></section>
