<div class="hire-service-grid">
<article class="hire-service-card"><span class="hire-card-top"><span>01 / DESIGN</span><span>✳</span></span><h3 id="section-3">Creative design &amp; UI</h3><p>Website layouts, landing pages, social creatives and responsive interface improvements with a clear visual system.</p><a href='/services'>Explore design services <span>↗</span></a></article>
<article class="hire-service-card"><span class="hire-card-top"><span>02 / WEB</span><span>⌘</span></span><h3 id="section-4">Web development</h3><p>Responsive websites and frontend interfaces using HTML, CSS, JavaScript and React where the project fits.</p><a href='/services'>Explore web services <span>↗</span></a></article>
<article class="hire-service-card"><span class="hire-card-top"><span>03 / INTEGRATION</span><span>⤳</span></span><h3 id="section-5">APIs &amp; automation</h3><p>API connections, workflow experiments and practical AI-assisted features with understandable limits and testing.</p><a href='/services'>Explore integrations <span>↗</span></a></article>
<article class="hire-service-card"><span class="hire-card-top"><span>04 / DISCOVERY</span><span>⌕</span></span><h3 id="section-6">Technical SEO &amp; review</h3><p>Metadata, sitemap checks, crawlability, page structure and actionable technical improvements—without ranking guarantees.</p><a href='/services'>Explore technical support <span>↗</span></a></article>
