<section aria-labelledby="hire-process-title" class="hire-process"><div class="faq-workspace-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">A SIMPLE, TRANSPARENT FLOW</p><h2 id="hire-process-title">From first message<br>to <em>final handover.</em></h2></div><p>No vague promises. Just clear steps.</p></div>
<div class="hire-process-list"><article><span>01</span><div><h3 id="section-8">Share the brief</h3><p>Explain the problem, audience, goal and any references you like.</p></div><small>DISCOVER</small></article><article><span>02</span><div><h3 id="section-9">Agree on scope</h3><p>Confirm deliverables, exclusions, budget, dependencies and timeline.</p></div><small>ALIGN</small></article><article><span>03</span><div><h3 id="section-10">Build and review</h3><p>Work through the agreed tasks and review important decisions as we go.</p></div><small>CREATE</small></article><article><span>04</span><div><h3 id="section-11">Test and hand over</h3><p>Check the agreed functionality, responsive behaviour and links before delivery.</p></div><small>DELIVER</small></article></div>
</section>
